-- data/wine-map/place-profiles.json. Do not hand-edit: the generator resolves every grape name and
-- canonical_key against the live catalog and refuses to emit anything if one of
-- them does not resolve. That check is the point of it. A grape name the
-- catalog does not carry does not raise on insert -- the join simply matches
-- nothing and the row vanishes, leaving a place quietly short of a variety.
--
-- 24 places: portugal 20, spain 4.
-- 44 style rows, 77 grape rows, 4 Bereich articles,
